Package: shomer-cli
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Shomer admin CLI.
 Operator command-line tool for Shomer authorization servers.
 Ships the `shomer` executable: probe a running instance with
 `shomer health <url>`, print the CLI version, and (later) manage
 OAuth2 clients, users and tenants.
